{"id":"c8e5d73279cd6c19","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-polymorphic-fibration.md","title":"多态语境的基本纤维结构","display":"df-polymorphic-fibration — 多态语境的基本纤维结构","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","chapter":"1","label":"16-df-polymorphic-fibration","aliases":["16-df-polymorphic-fibration","Polymorphic fibration"],"display":"df-polymorphic-fibration — 多态语境的基本纤维结构","depends_on":["[[16-df-fibration]]","[[16-df-finite-limits]]","[[16-df-fibred-finite-products]]","[[16-df-generic-object]]"],"source":"Definition 8.4.1, p. 471 (PDF 491); Example 8.4.2, pp. 471–472 (PDF 491–492)","revision_date":"2026-10-16"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-polymorphic-fibration"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-polymorphic-fibration</span><span>Polymorphic fibration</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-polymorphic-fibration — 多态语境的基本纤维结构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c9801f31ec8ac53f\" href=\"?note=c9801f31ec8ac53f\" title=\"16-df-fibration\">16-df-fibration</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b75e7c168ac56b22\" href=\"?note=b75e7c168ac56b22\" title=\"16-df-finite-limits\">16-df-finite-limits</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ee7c0663947fd7d2\" href=\"?note=ee7c0663947fd7d2\" title=\"16-df-fibred-finite-products\">16-df-fibred-finite-products</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f600e95377e8cbf9\" href=\"?note=f600e95377e8cbf9\" title=\"16-df-generic-object\">16-df-generic-object</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Definition 8.4.1, p. 471 (PDF 491); Example 8.4.2, pp. 471–472 (PDF 491–492)"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-16"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\">\\(p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\\)</span> 为候选函子；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fib}(p)\">\\(\\mathrm{Fib}(p)\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c9801f31ec8ac53f\" href=\"?note=c9801f31ec8ac53f\" title=\"16-df-fibration\">16-df-fibration</a>。满足纤维化条件时固定提升选择，并使用相应纤维 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E_I\">\\(\\mathcal E_I\\)</span> 与重索引。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FinProd}(\\mathcal B)\">\\(\\mathrm{FinProd}(\\mathcal B)\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b75e7c168ac56b22\" href=\"?note=b75e7c168ac56b22\" title=\"16-df-finite-limits\">16-df-finite-limits</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FibFinProd}(p)\">\\(\\mathrm{FibFinProd}(p)\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"ee7c0663947fd7d2\" href=\"?note=ee7c0663947fd7d2\" title=\"16-df-fibred-finite-products\">16-df-fibred-finite-products</a>。它同时要求各纤维有限积存在及重索引保持其规范积比较。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E\">\\(G\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E\\)</span> 是泛对象候选，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Generic}_p(G)\">\\(\\mathrm{Generic}_p(G)\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"f600e95377e8cbf9\" href=\"?note=f600e95377e8cbf9\" title=\"16-df-generic-object\">16-df-generic-object</a>；其基对象为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"pG\">\\(pG\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PolyFib}\">\\(\\mathrm{PolyFib}\\)</span> 在下文定义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PolyFib}(p)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Fib}(p)\\land\\mathrm{FinProd}(\\mathcal B)\\land\\mathrm{FibFinProd}(p)\n\\land(\\exists G\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E)\\ \\mathrm{Generic}_p(G).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{PolyFib}(p)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Fib}(p)\\land\\mathrm{FinProd}(\\mathcal B)\\land\\mathrm{FibFinProd}(p)\n\\land(\\exists G\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E)\\ \\mathrm{Generic}_p(G).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>这是 Definition 8.4.1 的基本多态纤维化，只描述种类语境和类型语境的结构。指数和类型量词是随后 Definition 8.4.3 的附加结构；旧定义把它与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda2\">\\(\\lambda2\\)</span>-纤维化混同，已纠正。</li>\n<li>泛对象 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 位于总范畴；书中常以其基对象 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega=pG\">\\(\\Omega=pG\\)</span> 代表种类 Type。基对象自身不能作为现有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Generic}_p\">\\(\\mathrm{Generic}_p\\)</span> 谓词的参数。</li>\n<li>分裂性还需将提升、泛对象与有限积结构严格指定；本页未把普通泛性强化为对象集合与分类箭头的严格双射。</li>\n<li>来源：Definition 8.4.1, p. 471（PDF 491）；Example 8.4.2, pp. 471–472（PDF 491–492）。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"c9801f31ec8ac53f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-fibration]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-finite-limits","status":"resolved","id":"b75e7c168ac56b22","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-finite-limits]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-fibred-finite-products","status":"resolved","id":"ee7c0663947fd7d2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-fibred-finite-products]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-generic-object","status":"resolved","id":"f600e95377e8cbf9","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · de