hrm{Generic}_p(G).","display":true},{"tex":"\\lambda2","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"\\Omega=pG","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Generic}_p","display":false}],"bytes":2065,"backlinks":[{"id":"928bcf665de24775","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$ 为带提升选择的纤维化。$\\mathrm{PolyFib}$ 采用 [[16-df-polymorphic-fibration]]，$\\mathrm{FibCCC}$ 采用 [[16-df-fibred-cartesian-closed]]，$\\mathrm{CCC}$ 采用 [[16-df-ccc-definition]]。$\\mathrm{Generic}_p(G)$ 采用基本多态纤维化明确引用的泛对象定义。"},{"id":"e385d16c80a7e662","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$ 为候选函子；$\\mathrm{PolyFib}$ 采用 [[16-df-polymorphic-fibration]] 的基本多态语境结构。$\\mathrm{PolyFib}^{\\mathrm{legacy}}$ 是下文定义的历史谓词。"},{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-114","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[16-df-stlc-syntax]]、[[16-df-stlc-syntactic-category]]、[[16-df-simple-type-semantics]]、[[16-thm-categorical-completeness]]、[[16-df-lambda-systems]]、[[16-df-polymorphic-signature]]、[[16-df-hagino-functor]]、[[16-thm-weak-initial-algebra]]、[[16-ex-church-weak-nno]]、[[16-df-polymorphic-fibration]]、[[16-df-lambda-fibrations]]。"}],"outgoing":["c9801f31ec8ac53f","b75e7c168ac56b22","ee7c0663947fd7d2","f600e95377e8cbf9"]}